# The main path through the blend laboratory.
#
# One `u v` pair per line, in metres. `#` comments, `closed` on its own line to
# join the ends. Deliberately not RON, despite the extension the document names:
# a path is dozens to hundreds of points produced by a tool, and a line-based
# format diffs one point per line — so a version-control history shows *which
# part of the path moved*, where a RON array reflows and shows the whole thing.
#
# It also keeps the parser inside `terrain_core`, which takes no deserialiser,
# so sampling a spline does not drag a format crate into every consumer.

-40   -18
-28   -12
-16    -4
 -6     2
  4     5
 14     6
 24     4
 33    -1
 40    -9
